<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7561" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cēro</span></b> , āvi, ātum,
		1, v. a.
		cera, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to cover</i>, <i>overlay</i>, or <i>smear with wax</i>, <i>to wax</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dolia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col. 12, 52, 15</span></i>
			.—More freq. in <i>part. pass.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cerata tabula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. As. 4, 1, 18</span></i>
			: tabella, * <i><span class="en">Cic. Div. in Caecil. 7, 24</span></i>; cf.
				<i><span class="en">Dig.
				32, 52</span></i>: pennae, * <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 4,
				2, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">taedae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. H.
					7, 23</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rates,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib.
					5, 42</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">puppes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. R. Am. 447</span></i>
			.</div>
